    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The problem is that the stillness feels like it's not just a pause. It feels like the beginning of a long, slow fade. I look at the years ahead and i don't see more music or more truth... i just see the decline. the blurring of the edges. it feels wrong to wait for the light to flicker out and lose the clarity i have right now.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
